 "remarks": "Spacious & Smart - Effortless Living Awaits. Welcome to Riverturn, a sought-after community where comfort, privacy, and convenience blend seamlessly in this multi-level townhouse. Designed for modern living, the home offers bright, open spaces paired with thoughtful details throughout. The main level features gleaming hardwood floors and a generous living/dining area with a cozy gas fireplace, and glass doors to a private deck. A powder room and an eat-in kitchen with a charming bay window and stainless appliances, complete this main floor. Upstairs, the primary suite impresses with vaulted ceilings, a skylight with electric shade, two large closets, and a private ensuite bath. The second bedroom is equally spacious, with easy access to the hall bath. A versatile loft - perfect as a home office, gym, or extra living space - includes additional walk-in storage. The lower level adds even more flexibility, with a large rec room, full bath, laundry, and direct access to your one-car garage. Riverturn's prime location puts shopping, dining, and the Merritt Parkway within easy reach - and Trader Joe's is just a private-gate walk away. Minutes from downtown Stamford, this home delivers peaceful, low-maintenance condo living with zero outdoor upkeep. A rare find - don't miss it! Seller prefers an \"as-is\" sale for convenience.",
